node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
fixtures
.git
.env

# tsc --build's incremental state. CI runs `npm run build` before `docker
# build`, so without this the runner's freshly written *.tsbuildinfo travels
# into the image while **/dist above keeps the outputs it describes out. Inside
# the image tsc then reads that state, concludes everything is up to date, and
# exits 0 having emitted nothing -- leaving no packages/*/dist for the runtime
# stage to COPY.
#
# Both patterns are needed. A .dockerignore `*` does not cross a `/`, so
# `*.tsbuildinfo` alone matches only the repository root -- and tsc writes
# these next to each package's tsconfig, at packages/*/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo.
# That is why the first attempt at this fix did not take.
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
